window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Rosella has raised her three sisters since her father was imprisoned for the murder of their mother. They’ve survived years in the small village despite looming taxes and bad harvests. With another tax hike coming she can’t afford to pay, Rosella reluctantly arranges to sell her mother’s ring to protect her sisters from financially driven marriages.</p> <p></p> <p>What she didn’t bargain for was her sisters following her or finding a castle. When her sisters start pilfering items to steal so Rosella doesn’t have to sell the ring, the master of the cursed castle interrupts them. Unwilling to let her sisters pay a decade-long sentence for theft, she embarks on a journey to break the spell on the castle and free her sisters. Little does she know, not only are her sisters’ freedom and the castle’s liberation on the line, but so is her heart when she finds herself falling for the beast.</p> <p></p> <p>Content Warnings: Consensual romantic encounters, mention of sexual assault and domestic assault, blood, violence, death, family death, drowning, and murder</p>"; 
